# Workspaces: named sets of connections opened together.
#
#   [workspace:<name>]
#   member.1 = <group/name>|<protocol>|<monitor>
#
# protocol and monitor are optional; blank means the connection's default and
# no placement. monitor is 1-based in xrandr order: the member's window is
# moved there once it appears (a move, not a resize; already-live windows
# stay put). Connect one with `rcm workspace <name>`, double-click it in the
# Browse sidebar, or give it a keyboard shortcut under [sessions] in
# shortcuts.conf as `workspace:<name> = <combo>`.
